<title>USA: SBE Inc names Raimon Conlisk chairman.</title>
<headline>SBE Inc names Raimon Conlisk chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SAN RAMON, Calif. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBE Inc said Monday it named Raimon Conlisk chairman of the board.</p>
<p>Conlisk replaces William Gage, who resigned during the fourth quarter that ended October 31, 1996.</p>
<p>SBE said Conlisk has been a member of its board for six years.</p>
